        "longBusinessSummary": "Fast Finance Pay Corp. operates as a fintech company. The company offers ff24payments.com, a flexible payment processing platform for online retailers. It also provides ff24pay.com, an application that provides comprehensive banking and instant transfer services for various currencies to individuals and companies. The company's banking services include IBAN accounts, debit card, multi-currency processing, SEPA and SWIFT transfers, and support for recurring payment services. In addition, it offers Ok.de, a free mailer email service and instant messaging platform that provides news and comparison portal services; and OK.secure, a crypto wallet messenger service. The company is based in Forest Hills, New York. Fast Finance Pay Corp. is a subsidiary of Fast Finance 24 Holding AG.",
